        <li><strong>Direct Fulfillment &amp; Dropshipping:</strong> If you dispatch goods directly from third-party hubs, model your logistics with our <a href="/dropshipping-profit-calculator/" class="text-emerald-700 underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-emerald-900 font-medium">dropshipping profit calculator</a>.</li>
        <li><strong>GST &amp; TCS Withholdings:</strong> While Meesho charges 0% commission, statutory tax obligations remain mandatory. Calculate product GST using our <a href="/gst-calculator/" class="text-emerald-700 underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-emerald-900 font-medium">online GST calculator</a> and account for 0.5% marketplace withholding via our <a href="/tcs-calculator/" class="text-emerald-700 underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-emerald-900 font-medium">TCS on e-commerce calculator</a>.</li>
      </ul>

      <p class="pt-2">
        Use this free <strong>meesho seller calculator</strong> to calculate exact bank payouts, verify shipping slabs, and maximize net earnings on every customer order.
